=== Without PROTECTED_ACCESS_MANAGEMENT (denied) ===
--- DROP protected user ---
1
--- CREATE USER ... PROTECTED ---
1
--- ALTER USER ... PROTECTED (add) ---
1
--- ALTER USER ... NOT PROTECTED (remove) ---
1
--- CREATE USER OR REPLACE protected ---
1
--- ALTER protected RENAME ---
1
--- ALTER protected password ---
1
--- ALTER protected SETTINGS ---
1
--- ALTER protected SETTINGS PROFILE ---
1
--- REVOKE ALL FROM protected ---
1
=== Self-protection (denied even WITH privilege) ===
--- self-drop with privilege ---
1
--- self-revoke with privilege ---
1
=== With PROTECTED_ACCESS_MANAGEMENT (allowed on protected users) ===
--- alter protected SETTINGS ---
OK
--- set protected password ---
OK
--- set protected SETTINGS PROFILE ---
OK
--- revoke from protected ---
OK
--- add protection to regular user ---
OK
--- remove protection ---
OK
--- create protected user ---
OK
--- rename protected user ---
OK
--- replace protected user ---
OK
--- drop protected user ---
OK
